<title>USA: Unidigital names Peter Saad COO.</title>
<headline>Unidigital names Peter Saad COO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unidigital Inc said on Monday it had named Peter Saad chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The company said that Saad, who will continue as company director, was most recently a managing director for the New York money management firm Martin Bierbaum Money Markets Inc.</p>
